stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Route
    Route --> BusyQueue : existing active hand_busy / native Running branches
    BusyQueue --> BusySelected : claim original; Running selection
    BusySelected --> BusyWritten : paste + Enter; AnyTurn even if Finish races
    BusyWritten --> NativeQueued : publish receipt; original stays unavailable to Idle
    BusyWritten --> BusyWritten : duplicate Idle wake while receipt delayed; no re-exposure
    NativeQueued --> Running : native consumes this original once
    Route --> Booting : fresh / clear / resume Idle entry
    Booting --> StartupDialog : dialog appears during bounded wait
    StartupDialog --> Booting : approved existing plan + one bounded dialog Enter
    Booting --> Observe : scoped SessionStart startup/resume/clear
    Booting --> AwaitClearProof : current clear; old runtime binding retained
    AwaitClearProof --> DraftVeto : explicit new path + current clear Start + published canonical Pending
    Prepared --> AwaitClearProof : Pending seq or latest clear source changed; zero payload
    Prepared --> NewFileUnpublished : revalidated clear proof; one original before JSONL birth
    NewFileUnpublished --> Observe : transcript registration publishes new binding
    AwaitClearProof --> ClearCycle : before model requires new runtime binding
    ClearCycle --> ClearCycle : no payload, no new file, no binding; liveness RED
    Route --> Observe : existing Idle entry / verified daemon restore
    Observe --> Waiting : Running or Unknown in Idle-ready path
    Waiting --> Observe : scoped wake or periodic current transcript read
    Observe --> DraftVeto : current approved terminal Idle or first SessionStart proof
    DraftVeto --> Held : existing draft / unread / protected focus veto
    Held --> Observe : ordinary source observation and same-original wake
    Held --> ClearHeldWatch : clear first input remembers its attached path
    ClearHeldWatch --> DraftVeto : recovered veto; observe Some(captured path) and current proof
    ClearHeldWatch --> ClearHeldWatch : draft / unread / source changed; no keys
    ClearHeldWatch --> ClearHeldCycle : before uses None with retained old binding
    ClearHeldCycle --> ClearHeldCycle : no payload or file birth; liveness RED
    Held --> Held : persistent unread; progress boundary RED
    DraftVeto --> Prepared : existing draft admission permits Idle submission
    Prepared --> Observe : source / turn / latch revision / cancel changed
    Prepared --> Running : revalidate + existing first-key fence + one Idle submit
    Running --> Continuation : memento or output-guard root Stop; arm before notify / block response
    Continuation --> Continuation : summary + timer read; no Idle submit / compact
    Continuation --> AwaitFinal : late assistant beyond suppression floor
    AwaitFinal --> Observe : later approved hard terminal or verified final Stop pair
    Running --> Running : permission metadata clears terminal; continue reading later records
    Running --> Observe : current approved terminal
    Running --> Settled : exact original receipt; no replay of Unknown
    Settled --> Route : next original
    Observe --> CompactPending : source-bound usage crossing remembered
    Running --> CompactPending : remember request without a control key
    CompactPending --> CompactInFlight : approved terminal Idle + no latch + D + permit + confirmed literal/Enter
    CompactPending --> UnknownTransfer : first mutation uncertain; never replay
    CompactInFlight --> CompactInFlight : compact Start / PostCompact alone cannot authorize input
    CompactInFlight --> Observe : same source and generation + own closed local output; retire only own fence
    CompactInFlight --> Held : continuation remains fenced
    Observe --> ScreenStall : before model requires screen confirmation
    ScreenStall --> ScreenStall : narrow / resize never confirms; progress RED
